@startuml DFD_Level1
title DFD Level 1 - Sistem Absensi Karyawan Berbasis IoT (RFID)

skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #3498DB
  BorderColor #2980B9
  FontColor #FFFFFF
  FontSize 13
  FontStyle bold
  RoundCorner 0
}

skinparam card {
  BackgroundColor #2ECC71
  BorderColor #27AE60
  FontColor #FFFFFF
  FontSize 12
  FontStyle bold
  RoundCorner 25
}

skinparam database {
  FontSize 11
  BackgroundColor #F1C40F
  BorderColor #F39C12
}

skinparam arrow {
  Color #333333
  FontSize 10
  FontColor #333333
}

hide footbox

rectangle "Admin" as admin
rectangle "Device RFID" as device

card "1.0\nAutentikasi\nLogin" as P1
card "2.0\nKelola Data\nMaster" as P2
card "3.0\nProses Absensi\nRFID" as P3
card "4.0\nInput Absensi\nManual" as P4
card "5.0\nKelola\nLaporan" as P5

database "D1\nUsers" as D1
database "D2\nEmployees" as D2
database "D3\nDivisions" as D3
database "D4\nSchedules" as D4
database "D5\nAttendance" as D5

admin -right-> P1 : **Username & Password**
admin -right-> P2 : **Data Karyawan, Divisi, Jadwal**
admin -right-> P4 : **Data Absensi Manual**
admin -right-> P5 : **Request Laporan**

P1 -left-> admin : **Status Login**
P5 -left-> admin : **Laporan Absensi**

device -left-> P3 : **UID + Timestamp**
P3 -right-> device : **Notifikasi Hasil Absensi**

P1 -down-> D1 : **Cek Kredensial**

P2 -down-> D2 : **Simpan/Update Karyawan**
P2 -down-> D3 : **Simpan/Update Divisi**
P2 -down-> D4 : **Simpan/Update Jadwal**

P3 -down-> D2 : **Cek UID Terdaftar**
P3 -down-> D4 : **Cek Jam Standar**
P3 -down-> D5 : **Simpan Record Absensi**

P4 -down-> D5 : **Simpan Absensi Manual**

P5 -up-> D5 : **Ambil Data Absensi**
P5 -up-> D2 : **Ambil Data Karyawan**

legend bottom left
  |= Warna |= Keterangan |
  | <#3498DB> | Entitas Eksternal (Admin, Device RFID) |
  | <#2ECC71> | Proses (1.0 - 5.0) |
  | <#F1C40F> | Data Store (D1 - D5) |
  | Panah | Aliran Data |
endlegend

@enduml